--
[expr.prim.lambda.closure]: a generic lambda's operator() is a member function
template (each `auto` parameter is an invented template type parameter,
instantiated per call).  Lambda rework Phase F lowers a generic lambda to a
closure with such a template operator(), so its captures are real closure
members: a by-copy capture is a capture-time snapshot and distinct closures from
a factory have independent state.
